   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Subdermal Armor<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Subdermal Armor. In armor of SP 11 or lower, damage the user takes while On Fire is halved, rounding up. In armor of SP 12 or higher, the user can't be set On Fire at all, though fire-based weapons like incendiary ammunition and flamethrowers still hurt them. It can't go in a Full Body Conversion.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
